                                "sense_id": "de2168ce-9342-3c3a-b78e-32835e5d2df9",
                                "text": "[T]he ſecond [symptom] is, falſò cogitata loqui, to talke to themſelues, or to vſe inarticulate, incondite voices, ſpeeches, abſolete geſtures,[…]."
                            }
